<title>SOUTH AFRICA: SIMMER MINES IN TALKS, ISSUES CAUTIONARY.</title>
<headline>SIMMER MINES IN TALKS, ISSUES CAUTIONARY.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Simmer and Jack Mines Ltd announced on Thursday it was in talks which could have an effect on its share price.</p>
<p>It advised shareholders to exercise caution when dealing in their shares until a further announcement is made.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
